": [\n      "JavaScript (ES6+)"\n    ]\n  },\n  "colors": {\n    "primary": "#3A8DAD",\n    "secondary": "#F4E9D8",\n    "accent": "#2EC4B6"\n  },\n  "theme": "auto",\n  "layoutDescription": "Home screen features a prominent \'+ Log New Session\' button and a scrollable list of session cards. Logging a session uses a form with icon-based and slider inputs, mood picker, and dropdowns. Session details are shown in a card with edit/delete options. Stats dashboard uses simple, colorful charts. Oceanic backgrounds, icons, and soft blue/beige/teal hues are used throughout for a cohesive, beach-inspired look."\n}'}",
